{
    "background_story": "Ayden was a young boy who grew up in a cozy cabin nestled in the mountains. His family's fireplace was the heart of their home, where they would gather on chilly winter nights to share stories and warm up by the crackling flames. Ayden loved nothing more than listening to his grandfather's tales of adventure and bravery as they sat together by the fire. As he grew older, Ayden became fascinated with the art of stoneworking and eventually learned to craft beautiful fireplaces that became a staple of his family's construction business. Years later, when Ayden built his own home, he designed a stunning stone fireplace that became the centerpiece of his living room, where he would sit with his own family and continue the tradition of storytelling and warmth that his grandfather had started.",
